    "head_commit_message": "feat(store): one typed view onto the unit store for every pass (spec 35 step 6a)\n\nUnitView gives a typed property for every store column. A pass that writes holds the\ncolumns it names (hold, of, release); a pass that only reads takes copies (read). It\nreplaces FleeColumns, UnitHealth.Table and UnitPlace.table/read. Helpers that read one\nunit take the view; their scattered forms keep distinct names (UnitHealth.*_one,\nScrumStance.anchor_one, FormationWalk.place_of_one, UnitPlace.of). Every GDScript entry\ninto a native pass asserts no hold spans it. check_store_reads.py now takes only few: or\nreference: marks and flags UnitHealth.*_one and FormationRout.where. The loops it would\notherwise flag (pursuit, regroup, the march's and rout blows' router points, the fight's\nhp writes) read or hold a view instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CLKjTdS1GGuKGjNmMvfaKy",
